  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response and Recovery for Typhoon Yagi 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Typhoon Yagi, one of the strongest storms over three decades with great intensity and wide range winds has stormed the Northern part of Vietnam in September 2024. The typhoon has left a destructive trail and continues to affect the lives and livelihoods of millions across northern regions. Dealing with the aftermath of the typhoon, the emergency relief to disaster is fundamental and necessary for millions of people to recover and build resilience in the aftermath of the Typhoon. On 9 September 2</narrative>
  </description>
